"助眠音量" = "Sleep volume";
"休息时，听见自然" = "Hear nature while you rest";
"有助眠音：可锁屏并与其他应用混音；若被其他应用或来电中断，需手动恢复。无助眠音：开始前需确认锁屏风险。保留尽力预约和无声通知，但 iOS 挂起后无法保证耳机响铃或震动。" = "With sleep audio: lock the screen and mix with other apps; resume manually after calls or interruptions. Without sleep audio: confirm the lock-screen risk before starting. Scheduling and silent notifications remain, but iOS suspension can prevent ringing and vibration.";
"试听铃声（仅耳机）" = "Preview alarm (headphones only)";
"提醒音量" = "Alarm volume";
"唤醒时震动" = "Vibrate on wake-up";
"震动由 iPhone 提供，受系统触感设置影响；锁屏及无助眠音挂起时不能保证震动。" = "Vibration comes from the iPhone and follows system haptic settings. It is not guaranteed while locked or suspended without sleep audio.";
"稍后提醒 %@ 分钟" = "Snooze for %@ min";
"到点时，按你的方式醒来" = "Wake up your way";
"内置铃声逐渐增强，经典与强力铃声更鲜明。最多提醒 3 分钟。实际响度也受 iPhone 媒体音量影响；初次使用请先用短计时确认。" = "Built-in alarms grow gradually; classic and strong sounds are more distinct. Reminders last up to 3 minutes. iPhone media volume also affects loudness. Test briefly before first use.";
"无法试听" = "Unable to preview";
"把安静留给周围，\n把提醒留给自己。" = "Keep the room quiet.\nKeep the reminder yours.";
"连接你的耳机" = "Connect your headphones";
"支持有线耳机和蓝牙耳机。请确认连接的是耳机，而不是蓝牙音箱或车载设备。开启降噪不影响耳机内的声音。" = "Wired and Bluetooth headphones are supported. Make sure the connection is to headphones, not a speaker or car system. Noise cancellation does not block audio played in headphones.";
"选择时长，开始休息" = "Choose a duration and rest";
"选择助眠音时支持锁屏并与其他音频混音；不播放助眠音时需先确认锁屏风险；保留尽力预约和无声通知，但挂起后不能保证响铃。首次使用请用 1 分钟计时验证实际表现。" = "Sleep audio supports locked-screen playback and mixing. Without it, confirm the risk first: scheduling and silent notifications remain, but ringing is not guaranteed after suspension. Test with a 1-minute timer on your device.";
"到点，轻轻唤醒" = "Wake up when it’s time";
"铃声逐渐增强，只使用已连接的耳机路由。耳机断开后停止播放。若断连发生在响铃期间，重连后尝试自动续响；休息中断连则需手动继续。" = "The alarm grows gradually and uses only connected headphone routes. Audio stops on disconnection. Reconnecting during ringing attempts automatic resume; disconnection during rest requires manual resume.";
"AirPods 聆听模式" = "AirPods listening modes";
"iOS 未提供应用可用的自动降噪／通透切换接口。休息结束时，可长按 AirPods 耳机柄，或在控制中心长按音量条切换。耳憩无法在锁屏后台自动切换模式。" = "iOS provides no public app interface for automatic noise-control switching. When your rest ends, hold the AirPods stem or hold the volume control in Control Center to change modes. HushNest cannot switch modes automatically in the locked-screen background.";
"请了解系统限制" = "Understand system limits";
"这不是系统闹钟。强制关闭应用、手机重启、耳机没电、来电或其他音频中断都可能使提醒停止。静默通知只是文字提示，不会外放铃声，也不能替代耳机提醒。" = "This is not a system alarm. Force-closing, restarting, low headphone battery, calls or other audio interruptions may stop reminders. Silent notifications are text only, never play a ringtone aloud and cannot replace headphone reminders.";
"自定义音轨无法读取，请重新导入或选择内置声音。" = "The custom audio could not be read. Import it again or choose a built-in sound.";
